## Phase 6: Performance Optimization

### Enable Image Optimization
Already built into Next.js - images are auto-optimized

### Setup Caching Headers

Update `next.config.js`:
```js
async headers() {
  return [
    {
      source: '/public/:path*',
      headers: [
        {
          key: 'Cache-Control',
          value: 'public, max-age=31536000, immutable',
        },
      ],
    },
  ];
}
```

### Monitor Performance

Use these tools:
