## Troubleshooting

### Port 3000 Already in Use
```bash
npx kill-port 3000
npm run dev
```

### TypeScript Errors
```bash
npm run type-check
```

### Build Fails
```bash
rm -rf .next
npm run build
```

### Styling Not Loading
Verify `globals.css` is imported in `layout.tsx`

